              "content": "Create a custom voice you can use for audio output (for example, in Text-to-Speech and the Realtime API). This requires an audio sample and a previously uploaded consent recording.\n\nSee the [custom voices guide](/docs/guides/text-to-speech#custom-voices) for requirements and best practices. Custom voices are limited to eligible customers.\n",
